            <ArticleTitle>Haemangiopericytoma of greater omentum. A rare cause of acute abdominal pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>649-50</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Haemangiopericytoma (HPT) is a rare neoplasm that can occur in any part of the human body. In this report, we describe the case of a patient with sudden severe upper abdominal pain caused by primary HPT in the greater omentum.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
